Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"QtmsJGQPbhGszzk6Fggskg","review_id":"ElCLxrzpsnmuWfh-GJ95kw","date":"2018-05-13T16:42:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9397192001342773,"text_excerpt":"This place is so cool! I wanted to surprise my daughter with a shake, and mission accomplished. I stopped in to this bright, cheery, sweet smelling paradise, and was greeted by two very nice ladies. They explained the process for creating a custom shake and we got down to business. I chose chocolate birthday cake ice cream as the base, one of the ladies added cream and began whipping it. Then we moved onto the syrup choice. It was strawberry for me. She drizzled it into the cup, then poured in the shake mixture. Next was the topping choice. Gummy bears, please. For the large topping I went with chocolate cookies. Three were arranged on top, and for the finale, another drizzle of strawberr..."},{"business_id":"QtmsJGQPbhGszzk6Fggskg","review_id":"msCbMrfct3OypibP4xCsiQ","date":"2017-11-13T16:58:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9325255155563354,"text_excerpt":"I absolutely this little place. The staff is friendly and the decor is cute and spacious for a little kids party. You choose your ice cream, and they create a shake for you! They offer endless topping options, everything from sprinkles, cereal, pop tarts, and lollipops to add to your shake. The business is fairly new so they didn't have their menu of signature shakes, nevertheless the experience of picking and choosing what you like is desirable. My daughter liked it but I think I loved it more than her . I will definitely be back"},{"business_id":"QtmsJGQPbhGszzk6Fggskg","review_id":"7owXDg3sP4l5GqsL9KQoZg","date":"2017-10-24T17:32:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9317699074745178,"text_excerpt":"Custom made extreme shakes!! You can add ANYTHING you want. Cheese balls, Rice Krispies, Nutella rim, whatever they have, you can have! The ice cream is made in house. They also have \"ice\" options that are gluten free and vegan. So there's something for everyone. And it's all delicious!! The staff is super sweet and excited about this place. They're still working out the kinks (I think this is just a soft opening for them), but it's great so far! They still need menus and instructions posted so they don't have to explain things two and three times to each customer. The place is SO cute. Plenty tables inside and one table outside. Like I said, they have work to do as far as finishing decor..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"QtmsJGQPbhGszzk6Fggskg","photo_id":"R6eYw8-f5Or3xZEy1v1O4A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/R6eYw8-f5Or3xZEy1v1O4A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9331636428833008},{"business_id":"QtmsJGQPbhGszzk6Fggskg","photo_id":"XWBkicmQ8AZn7GLXxEvQOw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/XWBkicmQ8AZn7GLXxEvQOw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.922743022441864},{"business_id":"QtmsJGQPbhGszzk6Fggskg","photo_id":"c2ahL8hdY5git_0g1HPhiA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/c2ahL8hdY5git_0g1HPhiA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8884954452514648},{"business_id":"QtmsJGQPbhGszzk6Fggskg","photo_id":"bp3ar810BQBMfTT-ro9bDA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/bp3ar810BQBMfTT-ro9bDA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8642481565475464},{"business_id":"QtmsJGQPbhGszzk6Fggskg","photo_id":"uyIazEveDmBc4FpyYGkkPQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/uyIazEveDmBc4FpyYGkkPQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.852128803730011}]},"notebook_case":null}
